{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19217","headline":"和南海马大夫闻杨侍郎出守郴州因有寄上之作 · 刘禹锡","name":"和南海马大夫闻杨侍郎出守郴州因有寄上之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽惊金印驾枝轓，遂别鸣珂听晓猿。\n碧落仙来虽暂谪，赤泉侯在是深恩。\n玉环庆远瞻台坐，铜柱勳高压海门。\n一咏琼瑶百忧散，何劳更树北堂萱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}